{# ============ VERSUS ============ #}
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="ca-vs-heading" x-data="versus()">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-4 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]">Alternatives</span>
      <h2 id="ca-vs-heading" class="text-balance text-[32px] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[44px]">Assistant, RPA, or custom agent?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Three ways to automate the same workflow, with very different failure modes. Compare the agent against either.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center" data-reveal><div class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-navy-100 bg-white p-1 shadow-sm" role="tablist"><template x-for="o in options" :key="o.id"><button type="button" role="tab" :aria-selected="side === o.id" @click="side = o.id" class="rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-[14px] transition-colors" :class="side === o.id ? 'bg-[#111827] text-white' : 'text-navy-600'" x-text="o.name"></button></template></div></div>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-navy-100 bg-white" data-reveal>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr_1fr] border-b border-navy-100 bg-[#FAFBFC] px-5 py-4 sm:px-8"><span></span><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6B7280]" x-text="current.name"></span><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]">Custom agent</span></div>
      <template x-for="(r, k) in rows" :key="r[0]">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr_1fr] items-start gap-x-3 border-b border-navy-100 px-5 py-4 last:border-b-0 sm:px-8"><span class="text-[14px] font-medium text-[#111827]" x-text="r[0]"></span><span class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]" x-text="r[1][side]"></span><span class="rounded-lg bg-[#76B900]/[0.08] px-3 py-1.5 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#111827]" x-text="r[2]"></span></div>
      </template>
    </div>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]" data-reveal>Where a process genuinely never varies, scripted automation is cheaper and more predictable, and we will say so. Agents earn their place where the input varies enough to break a script.</p>
  </div>
</section>

